    <node id="&quot;THE KILLERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Killers is an American rock band known for their greatest hits album 'Direct Hits', released in 2013."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0234-e4f3cfc59bff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIRECT HITS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Direct Hits is a greatest hits album by The Killers, released on November 11, 2013, featuring tracks from their first four studio albums and two new tracks."</data>
